; relief (docs/ART.md 5.3). Hills: solid rounded mounds, lit from the upper left (crest O, lit o),
; the ground tone in the middle (m), shaded right (q), a soft contour (w) down the dark side and under
; it; keyed in grass colours and remapped per terrain by the manifest, so a hill is its terrain raised.
; Never mirrored (ground.js). Peaks (tools/atlas/compose_map.py): faceted massifs, a lit west face
; (4-7, bone in the light) and a shaded east face (2-5) split at the ridge, a few ledges, snow caps
; of rime and frost (small on rock_*, deep on snow_*), void outline.

